# Font sources are downloaded once per site and never served directly.
# Committing them is fine and intended -- the subset output in public/fonts is
# what ships. Nothing to ignore here; this note exists so nobody adds a rule.

# Staged R2 payload: files too large for git, uploaded by `npm run r2:sync`.
# See r2/README.md. Never in git.
r2-assets/
